  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Trigger</strong> You are about to cast a spell using focus points, or cast a focus spell.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Requirements</strong> You possess a consumable item with the catalyst, talisman or fulu trait on hand, within reach or otherwise in reach of a material component pouch. This item must share a qualifying trait (see below) or specifically interacts with the triggering spell</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per hour</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You can use items and components that possess a suitable amount of ether to help charge your spell. To qualify, the consumable item must possess at least one trait that matches the spell being cast that is not concentrate, manipulate or a spell tradition trait, or the item interacts specifically with the spell.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You negate 1 point of the focus point cost. This consumes, uses, or activates the item, whichever applies. If the item can be used as part of the spell, such as a qualifying catalyst for the spell it is made for, the spell still benefits from the catalyst’s effects.</p>"
    },
